This blend function in our core crate feels slow when I'm painting on big canvases. Can you optimize it?

```rust
pub fn blend_normal(src: &PixelBuffer, dst: &mut PixelBuffer) {
    for y in 0..dst.height {
        for x in 0..dst.width {
            let s = src.pixel(x, y).unwrap();
            let d = dst.pixel(x, y).unwrap();
            let out = alpha_over(s, d);
            dst.set_pixel(x, y, out);
        }
    }
}
